{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "17歳 渡辺莉奈です。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/moboiDlG5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobjyv3I7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobE3crnD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobfymoM0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobWWDqs1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobm0My2X.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んな歌番組で披露させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遅くなったけど、オフショです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎回、振付師さんと表情や全体の雰囲気を決めているので番組ごとにメンバーの細かな表情の違いにも注目していただけるとより好きが強くなるかもね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "17thのシングル楽曲たち、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん愛してくださると嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在発売中の「BOMB」7月号の表紙を宮地すみれと務めさせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すみれと二人でのグラビアは初だったのですが、和やかな雰囲気での撮影で楽しかったな~"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobS7bsNg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mob8lsPpB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひお手に取っていただけたら嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『新劇場版☆ケロロ軍曹 復活して速攻地球滅亡の危機であります！』  本日、公開されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ついにスクリーンで観れる！！楽しみ~☆"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobxhkj66.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobZcDqDe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私をきっかけにケロロ軍曹を初めて観る方も久しぶりに観るよ~って方もいらっしゃってとても嬉しい渡辺です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "雨続きで気分が落ちちゃう日もあると思うのですがぜひこの映画でクスッと笑って元気になっていただけたらなと思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もケロロ軍曹たちに癒されたい~！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公式TikTokでインタビューが公開されてますので、そちらもチェックしてみてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}